==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|underwrite|er}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An entity assuming a financial risk.
# {{lb|en|insurance}} A person working for an [[insurance]] [[company]] who [[arrange]]s and [[authorize]]s an [[insurance policy]] with a [[broker]] or [[insured]].
# {{lb|en|finance}} An entity undertaking to market newly issued securities.
#: ''They were the '''underwriters''' of the company's shares, but only on a "best efforts" basis.''

